<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35998" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Phīdippus</span></b> , i,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φείδιππος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Grandson of Hercules</i>, <i>one of
				Helen's suitors</i>, <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab.
			80</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A famous courier</i>, v.
			Phidippides.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A physician of king Deiotarus</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Deiot.
				6, 17</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
